  "details": "With the advent of avatar search worlds it's possible to find public avatars that breaks TOS/guidelines (NSFW,hateful,etc), and a lot of them are pretty obvious just from the picture before you click on it. This was easy to report before because you would report the world you found the avatar in but now that you can search from avatar search worlds that wouldn't work if that's how you found it. There should be a way to be able to report an avatar that you find when searching without having to change into it to go into avatar details and clicking report.",
